<chapter num="34">
    <title>Solo Leveling</title>
    <author>Chugong</author>
    <illustrator>Jang Sung-Rak</illustrator>
    <body>
        <page pageNum="1">
            <caption type="narration">HE WHO FIGHTS WITH MONSTERS</caption>
            <caption type="narration">SHOULD LOOK TO IT THAT HE HIMSELF DOES NOT BECOME A
                MONSTER.</caption>
            <caption type="narration">AND IF YOU GAZE LONG INTO AN ABYSS,</caption>
            <caption type="narration">THE ABYSS</caption>
            <caption type="narration">ALSO GAZES INTO YOU</caption>
            <caption type="narration">-FREIEDRICH NIETZSCHE</caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="1" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="1"/> HUNTERS ARE THOSE WHO WITNESS COUNTLESS DEATHS AS WELL
                AS TAKE LIVES THEMSELVES </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="2" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> BECAUSE IT'S USUALLY A LIFE OR DEATH SITUATION, THEY NOT ONLY
                FIGHT AGAINST MONSTERS, BUT AMONGST THEMSELVES AS WELL. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="2">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="3" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE ARE ALREADY 'PERFECT' KILLING MACHINES. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="4" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> SAME GOES FOR YOU. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="5" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU WOULDN'T LUMP HUNTERS AND ORDINARY HUMANS INTO THE ASME
                CATEGORY, WOULD YOU? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="6" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> SO... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="7" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> I'LL DIE BECAUSE I LOST. IT'S ONLY NATURAL. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="8" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> ...LET ME ASK YOU JUST ONE QUESTION. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="9" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT ARE YOU? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="10" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> AN ASSASSIN CLASS WITH HEALING MAGIC... AND EVEN DEBUFF ABILITIES
                ~ I'VE NEVER HEARD OF ANYTHING LIKE IT. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="11" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="2"/> HM. I'M NOT SURE EITHER. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="3">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="12" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> A BABBLE MOUTH MAY BE USELESS... BUT HAVING A LOT OF SECRETS ISN'T
                THAT GREAT EITHER. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="13" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> KUK! </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>[EFFECT: PARALYSIS WAS ACTIVATED.]</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>[EFFECT: BLEED WAS ACTIVATED.]</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="14" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU WON'T BE ABLE TO HIDE YOUR SKILLS ANYMORE SINCE YOU KILLED ME. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="15" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> ...... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="16" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LET'S SAY I'M A HUNTER THAT GROWS STRONGER FROM EACH FIGHT. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="17" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOW STRONG DO YOU THINK I CAN GET? </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="4">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="18" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> HUH... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="19" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOUR SHADOW... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="20" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> IS CONNECTED TO THE DARKNESS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="21" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU WILL BECOME... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="22" who="Gang Tae-Shik">
                <unique ans="n"/> AS STRONG AS YOUR SHADOW'S DEPTH IN THE DARK. </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>QUEST COMPLETE</info>
                <info>YOU HAVE COMPLETED</info>
                <info>[EMERGENCY QUEST: KILL THE ENEMIES!].</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>QUEST REWARDS</info>
                <info>SELECT YOUR REWARDS.</info>
                <info>[YOU MAY CHOOSE FROM THE REWARDS BELOW.]</info>
                <info>REWARD #1. STAT POINTS +5</info>
                <info>WILL YOU ACCEPT YOUR REWARDS?</info>
                <info>ACCEPT</info>
                <info>REFUSE</info>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="5">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="1" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CERTAINLY GOT MUCH, MUCH STRONGER THAN BEFORE. </bubble>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="2" who="Sung Jin-Woo">BUT FOR SOME REASON...</caption>
            <caption type="thought" thtNum="3" who="Sung Jin-Woo">I FEEL LIKE SOMETHING WITHIN ME IS
                LOST EVERY TIME I GET STRONGER</caption>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="23" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="3"/> JIN-WOO... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="24" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="n"/> THANK YOU. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="25" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="4"/> THANKS MR. SUNG. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="26" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE WOULD'VE DIED IF YOU WEREN'T HERE. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="27" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> NOW WHAT SHOULD WE DO ABOUT THIS SITUATION... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="28" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="n"/> SHOULDN'T WE LEAVE AND REPORT TO THE GUILD? </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="6">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="29" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE SHOULD CLOSE THE DUNGEON GATES FIRST. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="30" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> MR. SUNG, DON'T TELL THAT YOU'RE GOING TO SOLO THE BOSS ALO- </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="31" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> ...NO, I'VE SEEN YOUR SKILL, SO I WON'T TRY TO STOP YOU. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="32" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> I DO WANT TO GIVE THEM A PROPER BURIAL, BUT... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="33" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> SUCH A PITY. </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>ALARM</info>
                <info>-YOU HAVE RECIEVED [RUNE: STEALTH]</info>
            </systemMsg>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="7">
            <systemMsg type="information">
                <info>[RUNE: STEALTH]</info>
                <info>TYPE: RUNE</info>
                <info>A SKILL CAN BE OBTAINED BY BREAKING THE RUNE.</info>
            </systemMsg>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="4" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN OBTAIN HIS SKILL AFTER KILLING HIM? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="34" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE'LL GO FIRST AND REPORT TO THE GUILD. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="35" who="Lee Joo-Hee">
                <unique ans="n"/> HURRY, WE'LL BE WAITING OUTSIDE. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="36" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DON'T WORRY, IT WON'T TAKE LONG. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="37" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I KNOW YOU'RE ALIVE. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="38" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> GET UP. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="8">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="39" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHY DID YOU TRY TO ACT DEAD? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="40" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU TRYING TO RUN WITHOUT ANYONE KNOWING? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="41" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AH, YOU CAN'T TALK. GANG TAE-SHIK WAS PRETTY BRUTAL. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="42" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HE PRECISELY CUT ONLY THE VOCAL CORDS... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="43" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> PROBABLY WOULD'VE KILLED YOU IN THE MOST PAINFUL WAY POSSIBLE
                AFTER ENSURING YOU WOULDN'T BE ABLE TO SCREAM. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="44" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AT THIS RATE, YOU'LL DIE OF BLOOD LOSS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="45" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF WE ASK MISS JU-HEE, YOU'D PROBABLY LIVE. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="5" who="Prisoner1">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="5"/> YE... YES, I'M SAVED. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="6" who="Prisoner1">
                <unique ans="n"/> WAIT... THIS WAY IS... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="46" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> STAY STILL </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="7" who="Prisoner1">
                <unique ans="n"/> THIS ISN'T THE WAY OUT! </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="9">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="8" who="Prisoner1">
                <unique ans="n"/> TH... THIS PLACE IS! </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="47" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DO YOU REMEMBER THE FACES OF ALL YOUR VICTIMS? </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="10">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="48" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU'TRE TRASH EVEN BEYOND GANG TAE-SHIK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="49" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> NO WAY I'D TAKE A MONSTER LIKE YOU OUTSIDE. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="11">
            <caption type="narration">AND A SILENT WAIL ECHOED THROUGHOUT THE DISTANCE...</caption>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="12">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="9" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> DEFEATING THE HOBGOBLIN WASN'T TOO DIFFICULT OF A TASK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="10" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AFTER LEAVING THE DUNGEON, MR. SONG CHI-YUL AND MISS JU-HEE
                EXPLAINED TO THE GUILD EMPLOYEE WHAT HAPPENED. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="11" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE EMPLOYEE REALIZED THE SITUATION WAS TRULY MASSIVE AND
                HURRIEDLY CONTACTED HER SUPERIORS. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="12" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AND ONE OF THE ELITES ARRIVED QUICKLY ON THE SCENE. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="13">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="50" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="6"/> HOW MANY MINUTES HAVE PASSED SINCE THE DUNGEON WAS
                CLEARED? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="51" who="Clerk">
                <unique ans="y" uniNum="7"/> IT'S BEEN ABOUT 40 MINUTES, SIR. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="52" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> ONLY 20 MINUTES LEFT, THEN... IT'S BEEN TOO LONG. TRY AND RECOVER
                THE VICTIM'S BODIES WITHIN 8 MINUTES, IF IMPOSSIBLE, QUIT AND RETURN BACK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="53" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> DID THE SURVIVORS CLEAR THE DUNGEONS THEMSELVES? </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="54" who="Clerk">
                <unique ans="n"/> YES, SIR. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="13" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> GANG TAE-SHIK TRIED TO KILL THE REMAINING HUNTERS DURING A
                CONTRACT ASSASSINATION, HUH... </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="14" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF THAT'S TRUE, THE HE WOULD'VE INTENTIONALLY LEFT BEHIND THE
                CORPSES BUT HE DELIBERATELY CLOSED OFF THE DUNGEON...? </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="15" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THIS MEANS HE HAD SOMETHING TO HIDE. </bubble>
        </page>

        <pageBrk/>

        <page pageNum="14">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="16" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> HUNTER SUNG JIN-WOO? </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="17" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IS THAT HUNTER SUNG JIN-WOO FROM LAST TIME? </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="18" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> I COULDN'T EVEN RECOGNIZE HIM AT FIRST. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="55" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> WE MEET AGAIN, HUNTER. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="56" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> AH, YOU'RE THE ONE FROM THE MONITORING DIVISION... </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="57" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> MY NAME IS WOO JIN-CHUL, HEAD OF THE MONITORING DIVISION. </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="58" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT SEEMS LIKE ONE OF OUR EMPLOYEES CAUSED GREAT HARM. WE'LL HAND
                YOU OUR OFFICIAL APOLOGIES AFTER THE CASE HAS BEEN RESOLVED, AND THE INVESTIGATION
                DIVISION WILL HANDLE THE CASE INSTEAD OF US. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="19" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT'S NOT THE TIME TO BE FULL OF MYSELF JUST BECAUSE I KILLED THE
                B-RANK HUNTER GANG TAE-SHIK. </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="20" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I DIDN'T KNOW BEFORE, BUT... </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="15">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="21" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> THIS PERSON IS STRONG.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="59" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> AS A MEMBER OF THE MONITORING DIVISION, I HAVE A FEW QUESTIONS I WOULD LIKE TO ASK YOU.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="22" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HE'S IN A DIFFERENT LEAGUE OF HIS OWN!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="23" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> HE'S AN A-RANK!
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="24" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN'T HANDLE HIM WITH MY STRENGTH RIGHT NOW.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="60" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THINGS WOULD GO SMOOTHLY IF YOU COOPERATED ~ WILL THAT BE OKAY?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="61" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> YES, I'LL COOPERATE.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="62" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THEN LET ME ASK YOU THIS DIRECTLY ~
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="63" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHO KILLED? THE B-RANK HUNTER GANG TAE-SHIK
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="16">
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="25" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> I PROBABLY CAN'T HIDE THAT I'VE BEEN REAWAKENED NOW
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="26" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> LOOKS LIKE I'LL HAVE TO VOID MY CONTRACT WITH JIN-HO,
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="27" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> SINCE HE WANTS A SKILLFULL YET LOW-RANKED HUNTER.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="64" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT WAS ME.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="65" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> I'M THE ONE THAT KILLED GANG TAE-SHIK.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="66" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF YOU DON'T MIND, WOULD YOU TELL ME YOUR RANK?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="67" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> C-RANK.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="68" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOW COULD YOU BEAT A B-RANK AS A C-RANK...?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="69" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> DO YOU NOT SEE WHO'S BEHIND ME?
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="17">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="70" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> WELL... IF YOU DID RECIEVE SUPPORT FROM A B-RANK, I GUES YOU COULD'VE BAETEN HIM.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="28" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> BUT GANG TAE-SHIK... HE WAS SOMEONE THAT COULDN'T BE CONTROLLED EVEN WITHIN THE DIVISION.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="thought" thtNum="29" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> COULD A ONE-ARMED C-RANK REALLY BEAT A SKILLED B-RANK ASSASSIN IN COMBAT?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="71" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> COME WITH ME FOR NOW. I'M AFRIAD I'M GOING TO NNED YOUR HELP FILLING OUT SOME REPORTS.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="72" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> MISTER.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="73" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHY DID YOU LIE?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="74" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> I JUST ASSUMED YOU HAD ENOUGH REASON TO HIDE YOUR ABILITIES. WHAT, WAS I WRONG TO DO SO?
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="18">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="75" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU CAN'T ESCAPE THE INVESTIGATIONS ANYWAYS.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="76" who="Song Chi-Yeol">
                <unique ans="n"/> I CAN'T PAY YOU BACK FOR WHAT YOU'VE DONE, BUT THIS IS THE LEAST THAT I CAN DO.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="77" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> HUNTER SUNG JIN-WOO.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="78" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> I DON'T THINK AN E-RANK LIKE YOU COULD'VE DEFEATED A B-RANK HUNTER LIKE GANG TAE-SHIK.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="79" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> I ALSO THINK IT'S UNNECESSARY TO SUSPECT YOU OF RE-AWAKENING AGAIN.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="80" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> HOWEVER, LET ME TELL YOU THIS; AFTER ALL, IF YOU'RE NOT CAREFUL, YOUR LIFE MAY END SOMETIME SOON.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="81" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> WHAT DO YOU MEAN?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="82" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IN THE EXTERMINATION OF HUANG DONG-SUL'S ASSAULT TEM, THE ONLY SURVIVORS WERE A D-RANK AND YOU.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="83" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE PROBLEM IS THAT HUANG DONG-SUK'S YOUNGER BROTHER HUANG DONG-SU, MAY SEEK REVENGE ON YOU GUYS.
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/> 
        
        <page pageNum="19">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="84" who="Sung Jin-Woo">
                <unique ans="n"/> YOU'RE TALKING ABOUT THE S-RANK HUANG DONG-SU?
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="85" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> YES.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="86" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT DOESN'T REALLY MATTER WHAT HAPPENED DURING THAT RAID.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="87" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THE IMPORTANT FACT IS THAT YOU, SUNG JIN-WOO, SURVIVED.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="88" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> SINCE HE'S AN S-RANK, THE LAW CAN'T REALLY BIND HIM EITHER.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="89" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> THEY'RE LIVING MIRACLES AND, AT THE SAME TIME, CALAMITIES.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="90" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IT'D BE IN YOUR INTEREST TO WATCH OUT FOR HIM.
            </bubble>
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="91" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> BECAUSE YOU MAY BE HUNTED BY SOMEONE WHO EVEN MONSTERS FEAR.
            </bubble>
        </page>
        
        <pageBrk/>
        
        <page pageNum="20">
            <bubble type="speech" spNum="92" who="Woo Jin-Chul">
                <unique ans="n"/> IF POSSIBLE, LEAVING THE COUNTRY WITH YOUR LOVED ONES ISN'T A BAD IDEA.
            </bubble>
            <systemMsg type="statSheet">
                <info>STATUS</info>
                <info>NAME: SUNG JIN-WOO</info>
                <level>LEVEL: 27</level>
                <info>JOB: NONE</info>
